# Rust + Tauri

Before substantive edits, **Read**:

1. `.cursor/skills/rust-tauri/SKILL.md`
2. `.cursor/skills/rust-security/SKILL.md`
3. `.cursor/skills/rust-architecture/SKILL.md` when changing structure/crates

## Always

- WebView untrusted; secrets/crypto/hardware/HTTP pairing in Rust
- Minimal capabilities; plugin install = cargo + `.plugin` + capability permission
- Typed `PublicError` codes over IPC
- Async or `spawn_blocking` for heavy work
- Register commands in one `generate_handler!`

## Never

- Postgres credentials or authoritative money/stock commits only in the desktop app
- Broad fs/shell/http permissions without review
- `unwrap` in command paths
- Secrets in frontend storage

## Prefer

- Feature modules (`pairing/`, `secrets/`, …) over god `lib.rs`
- `thiserror` + stable codes (existing `AppError` pattern)
- `reqwest` + rustls; `keyring` for secrets; `tracing` for logs

Binexus architecture: `docs/architecture/desktop-tauri.md`.
